@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false

title Ch06.09 - 실습 단계 1~2: 분리 아키텍처
left to right direction

actor Client

rectangle "Order Service (8080)" as order_service {
  component "OrderController" as order_controller
  component "OrderService" as order_app_service
  database "Order DB\n(orderdb)" as order_db
}

rectangle "Payment Service (8081)" as payment_service {
  component "PaymentController" as payment_controller
  component "PaymentService" as payment_app_service
  database "Payment DB\n(paymentdb)" as payment_db
}

Client --> order_controller : POST /api/orders
order_controller --> order_app_service
order_app_service --> order_db

order_app_service ..> payment_controller : HTTP POST /api/payments
payment_controller --> payment_app_service
payment_app_service --> payment_db

note bottom
  - 서비스별 독립 프로젝트/포트/DB
  - 결제 서비스는 order_id만 사용 (직접 FK 참조 없음)
end note
@enduml

@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false

title Ch06.09 - 실습 단계 3: 주문/결제 시퀀스

actor Client
participant "OrderController" as OC
participant "OrderService" as OS
database "Order DB" as ODB
participant "PaymentClient" as PC
participant "PaymentController" as PayC
participant "PaymentService" as PayS
database "Payment DB" as PDB

Client -> OC : POST /api/orders
OC -> OS : createOrder(request)
OS -> ODB : save(order:PENDING)
ODB --> OS : orderId

OS -> PC : processPayment(orderId, amount)
PC -> PayC : POST /api/payments
PayC -> PayS : processPayment(request)
PayS -> PDB : save(payment:PENDING)
PayS -> PDB : update(COMPLETED, transactionId)
PDB --> PayS : PaymentResponse
PayS --> PayC
PayC --> PC
PC --> OS : PaymentResponse(COMPLETED)

OS -> ODB : update(order:CONFIRMED)
OS --> OC : OrderResponse
OC --> Client : 201 Created
@enduml

@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false

title Ch06.09 - 실습 단계 4~5: Docker 배포/실행
left to right direction

node "docker compose\n(docker-compose-msa.yml)" as compose {
  node "order-service container\n:8080" as order_container
  node "payment-service container\n:8081" as payment_container
}

database "orderdb (H2 mem)" as orderdb
database "paymentdb (H2 mem)" as paymentdb

order_container --> payment_container : PAYMENT_SERVICE_URL
order_container --> orderdb
payment_container --> paymentdb

note bottom
  실행 순서:
  1) docker compose up -d --build
  2) health check (8080/8081)
  3) POST /api/orders 통합 테스트
end note
@enduml
